OL,3,GNEWSACase over alleged security force
OL,4,Ainvolvement in killing is adjourned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civil action over the alleged
OL,7,Finvolvement of serving British soldiers
OL,8,Fin the murder of a Gaelic football fan
OL,9,Fhas been adjourned until next year.
OL,11,FSean Farmer, 32, was on his way home
OL,12,Ffrom a GAA match when he was shot dead
OL,13,Falong with his friend Colm McCartney,
OL,14,F22, at a dummy roadblock in
OL,15,FAltnamackin, County Armagh, in 1975.
OL,17,FFarmer's family has taken a case
OL,18,Fagainst the Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,19,Falleging misfeasance in public office,
OL,20,Fnegligence and trespass to the person.
OL,21,FThe MoD denies liability.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
