OL,3,GNEWSACase over alleged security force
OL,4,Ainvolvement in killing is adjourned
OL,5,
OL,6,FProceedings at the High Court in
OL,7,FBelfast were adjourned after new
OL,8,Fmaterial emerged on the second day of
OL,9,Fthe case, with lawyers on both sides
OL,10,Fneeding more time to examine them.
